@@title SQ-DNR Oceanic and Ender's donor jars, 2026-11-01 ([creative_delight.md](../creative_delight.md) 36, [ocean_delight.md](../ocean_delight.md) 5.6, [ends_delight.md](../ends_delight.md) 5.3; TODO `creativedelight/framework #3`, `members #6`, `members #9`)
