@@text
@@text Needs the CD jar built 2026-11-01 20:42 or later (nests `portedOceanic-1.0.1-ce-19.2-02`, `endersAdditions-1.1.4-ce-19.2-03`) and the donor folders `oceanic_upstream/` and `enders_upstream/` beside `mods/` (already in the instance root). Full restart.
@@text
@@text > Rerun SQ-DNR-E-01 to -04 on the CD jar that nests `repackedEnds-1.19.2-2.1-ce-19.2-03` (Ender's 1.1.4 content merged into the End's member, ends_delight.md 5.9) and no `endersAdditions-*` jar. Same rows, same expected text: the startup message still names "Ender's Delight Additions (Creative Delight)"; the donor folder and sha1 are unchanged.
