## SQ-DNR-O-04
@phase worldgen
@group normal world
@commands Kill a salmon with a knife, an elder guardian, a squid; `/loot` a shipwreck supply and a buried treasure chest; fresh warm ocean
@pass Salmon eggs and elder eye drop as upstream (squid: one squid item, no tentacles); chests can hold salmon or ancient fish eggs; wild sea grape patches generate
@fails Modifier error in the log: codec `oceanic_delight:oceanic_delight_loot_modifier` not registered
@reviewed 2026-11-20
bootreject (?i)oceanic_delight:oceanic_delight_loot_modifier.*(not registered|unknown|error)
> forceload add 0 0 15 15
> fill 0 199 0 15 199 15 minecraft:glass
> cdevtest kill 4 200 4 minecraft:salmon n=5 held=farmersdelight:flint_knife
> cdevtest kill 8 200 4 minecraft:elder_guardian
> cdevtest kill 12 200 4 minecraft:squid held=farmersdelight:flint_knife
repeat 10
> loot spawn 4 200 12 loot minecraft:chests/shipwreck_supply
> loot spawn 4 200 12 loot minecraft:chests/buried_treasure
end
> cdevtest items 4 200 12 3
expect verb=kill drops=\S*oceanic_delight:salmon_eggs:
expect verb=kill drops=\S*oceanic_delight:elder_guardian_eye:
reject verb=kill drops=\S*tentacle
> execute positioned 0 70 0 run locate biome minecraft:warm_ocean
waitlog nearest minecraft:warm_ocean is at 300
capture WO is at \[(-?\d+), (~|-?\d+), (-?\d+)\]
> pbot spawn dnr4 {WO1} 120 {WO3} minecraft:overworld creative
sleep 30
# a count box is at most 262144 blocks (64x64x64): the box runs as slices; the shell sums them
> say DNRO04 begin
> cdevtest count {WO1-48} 20 {WO3-48} {WO1+47} 64 {WO3-1} oceanic_delight:wild_sea_grape
> cdevtest count {WO1-48} 20 {WO3} {WO1+47} 64 {WO3+47} oceanic_delight:wild_sea_grape
> say DNRO04 end
waitlog DNRO04 end 120
shell python3 -I -c "import re,sys;L=open('logs/latest.log',errors='replace').read().splitlines();a=sys.argv[1];i=max([k for k,l in enumerate(L) if a+' begin' in l]+[0]);t={};[t.__setitem__(m[1],t.get(m[1],0)+int(m[2])) for l in L[i:] for m in [re.search(r'verb=count block=(\S+) n=(\d+)',l)] if m];s=sum(int(m[1]) for l in L[i:] for m in [re.search(r'verb=count .*skipped_columns=(\d+)',l)] if m);print(a,'totals',t,'skipped_columns',s);z=[b for b in sys.argv[2:] if not t.get(b)];print('zero:',z);sys.exit(1 if z else 0)" DNRO04 oceanic_delight:wild_sea_grape
> pbot remove dnr4
expect verb=count block=oceanic_delight:wild_sea_grape n=[1-9]
reject (\[cdevtest\] .*done=0|verb=pbot\.\S+ .*error=)
look the chest items line may hold salmon or ancient fish eggs over the 20 rolls (chance-based: record, not judged); the squid kill drops one squid item; the warm ocean count above 0 (patches generate)
