@@section 2
@@title SQ-DNR Oceanic donor jar missing, 2026-11-20 (own failed-boot step; [creative_delight.md](../creative_delight.md) 36, [ocean_delight.md](../ocean_delight.md))
@@date 2026-11-01
@@jars creativedelight
@@sources feature_writeup/creative_delight.md feature_writeup/ocean_delight.md feature_writeup/ends_delight.md
@@reviewed 2026-11-20
@@prep run rm -f oceanic_upstream && mkdir oceanic_upstream
@@text
@@text Split out of section 1 (r1120fix, 2026-11-20): the row needs its own boot with the donor folder changed, and the server stops at
@@text startup (every row of the step has `bootreject Done \(`, so the driver waits for the stop instead of Done). The donor folder in
@@text the scratch server is a symlink to the instance's folder (scratch_server.sh setup); the prep replaces the symlink with a
@@text scratch folder and never touches the instance's donor jars.
@@table
## SQ-DNR-O-05
@group A
@commands Move `oceanic_upstream/oceanic_delight-1.0.1-forge-1.19.2.jar` away and start; then put any other jar there under that name and start; restore
@pass Startup stops with the "reads its textures, models and recipes from the original Oceanic Delight jar ... folder 'oceanic_upstream' ... missing" message and the Modrinth URL; the second run says "wrong file ... expected 91fd8842..."
@fails Game starts: `UpstreamJars.verifyOrFail` is not the first call of the constructor
@reviewed 2026-11-20
# r1120fix (2026-11-20): own step, section @@prep makes srv/oceanic_upstream an empty folder (r1120lr booted with the donor in
# place, so no message). Message format: development/shared/upstream/ce/shared/DonorJars.java (one line per part). The wrong-file
# half is the same shared DonorJars check, tested on the Ender's pin by SQ-DNR-E-04
bootexpect Oceanic Delight \(Creative Delight\) reads its textures, models and recipes from the original Oceanic Delight jar, which must be in the folder 'oceanic_upstream'
bootexpect missing: \S*oceanic_upstream/oceanic_delight-1\.0\.1-forge-1\.19\.2\.jar
bootexpect get it from https://cdn\.modrinth\.com/\S+/oceanic_delight-1\.0\.1-forge-1\.19\.2\.jar
bootreject Done \(
look the wrong-file half ("wrong file ... expected 91fd8842") is not run here: same DonorJars code as SQ-DNR-E-04

